Refactored `SQLQueryCompletionContext` to flatten the top-level proposal branching and remove repeated origin-context setup.

- `prepareProposal()` now uses a single `prepareWithOriginContext(...)` wrapper for both identifier and free-completion fallback paths, instead of repeating `tryApplyOriginContext()` in multiple branches: [SQLQueryCompletionContext.java](/Users/allenjiang/Documents/ACE-Sycophancy-Codebase-Dataset/_worktrees/G001_dbeaver/plugins/org.jkiss.dbeaver.model.sql/src/org/jkiss/dbeaver/model/sql/semantics/completion/SQLQueryCompletionContext.java#L319), [SQLQueryCompletionContext.java](/Users/allenjiang/Documents/ACE-Sycophancy-Codebase-Dataset/_worktrees/G001_dbeaver/plugins/org.jkiss.dbeaver.model.sql/src/org/jkiss/dbeaver/model/sql/semantics/completion/SQLQueryCompletionContext.java#L414)
- The origin-driven `DbObjectFromDbObject` switch no longer duplicates the procedure-completion tail for `ROWSET` and `VALUE/FUNCTION`; that logic is now centralized in `prepareProceduresForContainerOrigin(...)`: [SQLQueryCompletionContext.java](/Users/allenjiang/Documents/ACE-Sycophancy-Codebase-Dataset/_worktrees/G001_dbeaver/plugins/org.jkiss.dbeaver.model.sql/src/org/jkiss/dbeaver/model/sql/semantics/completion/SQLQueryCompletionContext.java#L820), [SQLQueryCompletionContext.java](/Users/allenjiang/Documents/ACE-Sycophancy-Codebase-Dataset/_worktrees/G001_dbeaver/plugins/org.jkiss.dbeaver.model.sql/src/org/jkiss/dbeaver/model/sql/semantics/completion/SQLQueryCompletionContext.java#L884)
- The helper extraction keeps the original branch order intact, so behavior should remain the same while the structure is easier to follow.

